  <!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
  <section class="bp-section alt">
    <div class="bp-inner">
      <p class="bp-eyebrow">How It Works</p>
      <h2>From <em>idea to live</em> in two weeks</h2>
      <p class="bp-lead">We don't rip out your existing tools. We build automation around them.</p>
      <div class="bp-steps reveal">
        <div class="bp-step">
          <div class="bp-step-num">1</div>
          <div class="bp-step-body">
            <h4>Discovery Audit</h4>
            <p>We map every manual process eating your team's time. Usually in a single 45-minute session. We look at inboxes, spreadsheets, CRMs, and communication tools to identify exactly where automation will have the biggest impact.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bp-step">
          <div class="bp-step-num">2</div>
          <div class="bp-step-body">
            <h4>Build &amp; Integrate</h4>
            <p>We build the automation workflows and connect them to your existing tools. No new software to learn. Everything pipes into the systems you already use (CRM, email, Slack, Google Sheets, etc.).</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bp-step">
          <div class="bp-step-num">3</div>
          <div class="bp-step-body">
            <h4>Test &amp; Refine</h4>
            <p>We run the automations in parallel with your current process so you can verify they work exactly as expected before cutting over. Typically takes 3–5 days.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bp-step">
          <div class="bp-step-num">4</div>
